Six-axis gun positioner kit, retired. Its sources and records are at
https://github.com/derekbreden/homesodamachine/tree/archive-six-axis-positioner/hardware/printed-parts/fixtures/gun-positioner
The weld positioner in use is PGFUN, in hardware/printed-parts/fixtures/pgfun-positioner.
This marker keeps its published models off the site.
